          "text": "Framing and exact resolver: this targets the DOL ETA weekly claims release variant labeled seasonally adjusted Insured Unemployment, not unadjusted continued weeks claimed in all programs. The target week is week ending June 27, 2026, first print, converted from thousands to millions."
