          "text": "Reference class and base rate: for a one-week-ahead SA initial-claims print, the most relevant reference class is the DOL weekly SA history in the current release table. Over the fetched 54 weekly values from June 21, 2025 through June 27, 2026, levels mostly sit around 200k-236k, with the latest four weeks 230k, 227k, 216k, and 215k and the latest 4-week average at 222k. The base rate is therefore a near-flat next print around the latest level to recent average, before holiday-week and noise adjustments."
