          "text": "Reference class base rate: recent official first-print core CPI m/m values are centered near 0.25 percent, while the latest BLS print and the Cleveland Fed June nowcast both sit closer to 0.2 than 0.3. That argues for a point just below the simple recent average, not a break to a new high or a zero-like print."
